<section class="flow has-gap-s" hlight-section-h>
    <h2 class="has-mb-xs">Wait a minute, isn’t the web, like... dead?</h2>
    <p>The old web, the one of clicking blue links until you get to an answer is fading. Discovery is happening more through social, AI answers, and zero-click search. BUT...</p>
    <p>The website remains the owned destination where a customer can verify credibility, read up on all the details, and take action. It’s no surprise, in fact, that together with blogging and SEO, websites remain top ROI-generating channels.</p>
    <p>And yet, I have seen innumerable people squander way too much money on sloppy approaches that inevitably confuse people and ruin their reputation.</p>
    <p>Here’s to that not happening again. Cheers!</p>
</section>

